---
title: "cancel (LegionPreLiquidApprovedSale)"
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> q_check_auth: projectAdmin calls cancel()
    q_check_auth --> q_revert_auth: caller is not projectAdmin
    q_check_auth --> q_check_supplied: caller is projectAdmin
    q_revert_auth --> [*]: revert Unauthorized
    q_check_supplied --> q_revert_supplied: tokensSupplied == true
    q_check_supplied --> q_check_canceled: tokensSupplied == false
    q_revert_supplied --> [*]: revert TokensAlreadySupplied
    q_check_canceled --> q_revert_already: isCanceled == true
    q_check_canceled --> q_check_withdrawn: isCanceled == false
    q_revert_already --> [*]: revert AlreadyCanceled
    q_check_withdrawn --> q_require_return: capital has been withdrawn
    q_check_withdrawn --> q_set_cancel: capital not yet withdrawn
    q_require_return --> q_check_returned: project must return full amount including fees
    q_check_returned --> q_revert_insufficient: returned amount insufficient
    q_check_returned --> q_set_cancel: full amount returned to contract
    q_revert_insufficient --> [*]: revert InsufficientReturnedCapital
    q_set_cancel --> q_emit: isCanceled = true
    q_emit --> [*]: emit SaleCanceled()

    note right of q_check_withdrawn
        INV-001: Cancellation only allowed before tokensSupplied
        INV-002: If capital was withdrawn, project must return full raised amount + fees
        INV-003: isCanceled transitions from false to true exactly once
        INV-004: After cancellation, investors can withdraw via withdrawInvestedCapitalIfCanceled
    end note
